  "bug_report_content": "Title: Base64 bug with empty input (new byte[0])\nType: Bug | Priority: Major | Status: Closed | Resolution: Fixed\n\nDescription:\nBase64.encode(new byte[0]) doesn't return an empty byte array back!  It returns CRLF.\n\nComments:\n\n[Julius Davies]: Fix for codec-77, including JUnits.\n\nAlso fixed two minor naming glitches in the JUnits.\n\n[Julius Davies]: Note:  codec-1.3 properly encodes empty-byte-array into an empty-byte-array.  So this is a regression on Trunk caused by the CODEC-69 patch I submitted.\n\n[ggregory@seagullsw.com]: Committed to SVN.",
